<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Gut Genug (with Skepta &amp; Blumengarten)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Blumengarten"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KITSCHKRIEG"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KitschKrieg"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Skepta"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Gut Genug (with Skepta &amp; Blumengarten)"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Gut Genug (with Skepta &amp; Blumengarten) - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="DEKF22601788"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3414346518"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0045SaAt2EzI0J"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="712355150"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="71zVyAO3nkykYTFBfiw1DM"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6797919981"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="2:36.460"><div begin="0.000" end="2:36.460"><p begin="0.000" end="2.890" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.000" end="0.400">Du</span> <span begin="0.490" end="0.890">bi</span><span begin="0.890" end="1.030">st</span> <span begin="1.030" end="1.380">gut</span> <span begin="1.510" end="2.040">ge</span><span begin="2.040" end="2.890">nug</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你已经足够好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你已經足夠好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are good enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君はそのままで十分だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 이미 충분히 잘하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es assez bien comme ça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eres más que suficiente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é bom o bastante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты достаточно хорош</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vai bene così</span></p><p begin="3.700" end="7.300" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.700" end="3.820">I</span><span begin="3.820" end="3.930">ch</span> <span begin="3.930" end="4.300">wei</span><span begin="4.300" end="4.460">ß</span> <span begin="4.460" end="4.760">ni</span><span begin="4.760" end="4.920">cht,</span> <span begin="4.920" end="5.350">wa</span><span begin="5.350" end="5.410">s</span> <span begin="5.690" end="5.900">die</span> <span begin="5.900" end="6.290">Welt</span> <span begin="6.420" end="6.870">dir</span> <span begin="6.870" end="7.300">sagt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道这世界对你说了些什么</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我不知道這世界對你說了些什麼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I don&apos;t know what the world tells you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">世界が君に何を言っているのかは知らない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">세상이 네게 무슨 말을 하는진 모르겠지만</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne sais pas ce que le monde te raconte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No sé qué te dice el mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sei o que o mundo diz a você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я не знаю что говорит тебе мир</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non so cosa ti dica il mondo</span></p><p begin="7.880" end="13.260" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.880" end="8.300">Blei</span><span begin="8.410" end="8.850">b ein</span><span begin="8.850" end="9.230">fa</span><span begin="9.230" end="9.380">ch</span> <span begin="9.380" end="9.870">nur</span> <span begin="9.870" end="13.260">du</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只管做你自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只管做你自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just stay true to yourself</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ただ君のままでいて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 너답게 살아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Reste simplement toi-même</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo sigue siendo tú</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Apenas continue sendo você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Просто оставайся собой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resta semplicemente come sei</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="10.820" end="12.580"><span begin="10.820" end="10.890">(K-</span><span begin="11.060" end="11.120">K-</span><span begin="11.310" end="11.390">K-</span><span begin="11.560" end="11.610">K-</span><span begin="11.810" end="11.960">Ki</span><span begin="11.960" end="12.100">tsch</span><span begin="12.100" end="12.520">Krie</span><span begin="12.520" end="12.580">g)</span></span></p><p begin="14.760" end="18.110" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.760" end="15.020">Du</span> <span begin="15.020" end="15.240">bist</span> <span begin="15.240" end="15.400">gut</span> <span begin="15.480" end="15.540">ge</span><span begin="15.630" end="18.110">nug</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你已经足够好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你已經足夠好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are good enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君はそのままで十分だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 이미 충분히 잘하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es assez bien comme ça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eres más que suficiente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é bom o bastante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты достаточно хорош</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vai bene così</span>