"L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.580" end="26.820">Du</span> <span begin="26.820" end="27.030">bist</span> <span begin="27.030" end="27.300">gut</span> <span begin="27.300" end="27.350">ge</span><span begin="27.460" end="30.490">nug</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你已经足够好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你已經足夠好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are good enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君はそのままで十分だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 이미 충분히 잘하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es assez bien comme ça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eres más que suficiente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é bom o bastante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты достаточно хорош</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vai bene così</span></p><p begin="42.780" end="47.040" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="42.780" end="43.130">Yeah,</span> <span begin="44.490" end="44.760">S</span><span begin="44.760" end="45.110">K,</span> <span begin="46.000" end="46.120">o</span><span begin="46.220" end="46.440">kay,</span> <span begin="46.440" end="46.710">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="46.710" end="46.910">rea</span><span begin="46.910" end="47.040">dy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 SK 好了 我准备好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">沒錯 SK 好了 我準備好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ SK よし 準備はできた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래 SK 좋아 난 준비됐어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ouais SK d’accord je suis prêt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sí SK está bien estoy listo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ja SK okay ich bin bereit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Isso aí SK certo estou pronto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Да SK ладно я готов</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sì SK va bene sono pronto</span></p><p begin="48.070" end="49.270" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="48.070" end="48.230">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="48.230" end="48.380">right</span> <span begin="48.460" end="48.570">where</span> <span begin="48.570" end="48.700">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="48.700" end="48.800">meant</span> <span begin="48.910" end="49.010">to</span> <span begin="49.090" end="49.270">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就在属于我的位置</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我就在屬於我的位置</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺はいるべき場所にいる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 지금 내가 있어야 할 바로 그곳에 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis exactement là où je dois être</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estoy justo donde debo estar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich bin genau da wo ich hingehöre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Estou exatamente onde deveria estar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я именно там где должен быть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sono esattamente dove dovrei essere</span></p><p begin="49.570" end="51.160" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="49.570" end="49.690">Your</span> <span begin="49.690" end="49.910">ad</span><span begin="49.910" end="50.210">vice</span> <span begin="50.210" end="50.420">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="50.420" end="50.550">ma</span><span begin="50.550" end="50.620">ke</span> <span begin="50.620" end="50.840">sen</span><span begin="50.840" end="50.930">se</span> <span begin="50.930" end="51.050">to</span> <span begin="51.050" end="51.160">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的忠告对我毫无意义</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你的忠告對我毫無意義</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前の忠告なんて俺には意味がない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네 충고는 내겐 전혀 말이 안 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tes conseils n’ont aucun sens pour moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tus consejos no tienen sentido para mí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dein Rat ergibt für mich keinen Sinn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Seus conselhos não fazem sentido para mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Твои советы для меня бессмысленны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I tuoi consigli non hanno senso per me</span></p><p begin="51.290" end="53.100" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="51.290" end="51.420">You</span> <span begin="51.420" end="51.560">weren&apos;t</span> <span begin="51.670" end="51.890">there</span> <span begin="51.890" end="51.980">when</span> <span begin="51.980" end="52.060">I</span> <span begin="52.150" end="52.350">nee</span><span begin="52.350" end="52.470">de</span><span begin="52.470" end="52.620">d you</span> <span begin="52.620" end="52.880">next</span> <span begin="52.880" end="53.000">to</span> <span begin="53.000" end="53.100">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我需要你陪在身边时 你却不在那里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當我需要你陪在身邊時 你卻不在那裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">そばにいてほしい時 お前はいなかった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 곁에 네가 필요했을 때 넌 없었잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu n’étais pas là quand j’avais besoin de toi près de moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No estuviste a mi lado cuando te necesitaba</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du warst nicht da als ich dich an meiner Seite brauchte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você não estava lá quando precisei de você ao meu lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тебя не было рядом когда ты был мне нужен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non c’eri quando avevo bisogno di te accanto</span></p><p begin="53.220" end="55.060" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="53.220" end="53.350">So</span> <span begin="53.350" end="53.490">now</span> <span begin="53.490" end="53.610">I</span> <span begin="53.610" end="53.830">gotta</span> <span begin="53.830" end="54.120">tur</span><span begin="54.120" end="54.220">n up</span> <span begin="54.340" end="54.510">res</span><span begin="54.600" end="54.810">pect</span><span begin="54.810" end="54.950">ful</span><span begin="54.950" end="55.060">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以现在我得体面地火力全开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所以現在我得體面地火力全開</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">だから今 敬意を忘れず派手にぶちかます</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그러니 이제 예의를 지키며 제대로 불태워야 해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors maintenant je dois tout donner avec respect</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así que ahora me toca darlo todo con respeto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Also dreh ich jetzt mit Respekt auf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então agora vou subir o nível com todo o respeito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так что теперь я прибавлю со всем уважением</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quindi ora devo fare sul serio con rispetto</span></p><p begin="55.260" end="56.770" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="55.260" end="55.350">They</span> <span begin="55.350" end="55.460">wan</span><span begin="55.460" end="55.520">na</span> <span begin="55.600" end="55.800">bring</span> <span begin="55.800" end="55.870">me</span> <span begin="55.960" end="56.190">down,</span> <span begin="56.190" end="56.250">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="56.340" end="56.560">too</span> <span begin="56.560" end="56.770">high</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们想把我拉下来 可我站得太高</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">他們想把我拉下來 可我站得太高</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">奴らは俺を引きずり下ろしたがる でも俺は高すぎる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">날 끌어내리려 하지만 난 너무 높이 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ils veulent me faire tomber mais je suis trop haut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quieren derribarme pero estoy demasiado alto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sie wollen mich runterziehen doch ich bin zu hoch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Querem me derrubar mas estou alto demais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Они хотят сбить меня но я слишком высоко</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vogliono tirarmi giù ma sono troppo in alto</span></p><p begin="56.840" end="58.770" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="56.840" end="57.030">Don&apos;t</span> <span begin="57.030" end="57.290">care a</span><span begin="57.290" end="57.430">bout</span> <span begin="57.430" end="57.550">the</span> <span begin="57.550" end="57.750">al</span><span begin="57.750" end="57.870">ti</span><span begin="57.870" end="58.110">tu</span><span begin="58.110" end="58.290">de, I&apos;m</span> <span begin="58.290" end="58.510">too</span> <span begin="58.510" end="58.770">fly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不在乎海拔 我就是如此耀眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我不在乎海拔 我就是如此耀眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">高度なんて気にしない 俺は飛び抜けてる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고도 따윈 신경 안 써 난 너무 멋지게 날아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me fiche de l’altitude je suis trop classe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No me importa la altitud vuelo demasiado alto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Höhe ist mir egal ich bin einfach zu fly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não me importo com a altitude eu voo alto demais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мне плевать на высоту я рождён летать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non mi importa dell’altitudine volo troppo in alto</span></p><p begin="58.770" end="1:00.640" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="58.770" end="58.850">I</span> <span begin="58.930" end="59.060">got</span> <span begin="59.160" end="59.250">lo</span><span begin="59.250" end="59.290">ve</span> <span begin="59.370" end="59.430">to</span> <span begin="59.510" end="59.630">gi</span><span begin="59.630" end="59.730">ve,</span> <span begin="59.730" end="59.820">no</span> <span begin="59.900" end="1:00.020">more</span> <span begin="1:00.100" end="1:00.250">tear</span><span begin="1:00.250" end="1:00.340">s</span> <span begin="1:00.340" end="1:00.460">to</span> <span begin="1:00.460" end="1:00.640">cry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍有爱可以付出 再也没有泪可流</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我仍有愛可以付出 再也沒有淚可流</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">まだ与えられる愛がある もう流す涙はない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내겐 아직 나눌 사랑이 있어 더는 흘릴 눈물도 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’ai de l’amour à donner plus de larmes à verser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tengo amor para dar ya no quedan lágrimas que llorar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich hab Liebe zu geben keine Tränen mehr zum Weinen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tenho amor para dar e nenhuma lágrima para chorar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">У меня есть любовь которой я могу делиться слёз больше нет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho ancora amore da dare e nessuna lacrima da versare</span></p><p begin="1:00.640" end="1:02.750" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:00.640" end="1:00.760">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:00.850" end="1:01.100">too</span> <span begin="1:01.100" end="1:01.310">weird</span> <span begin="1:01.310" end="1:01.440">to</span> <span begin="1:01.530" end="1:01.640">li</span><span begin="1:01.640" end="1:01.710">ve</span> <span begin="1:01.710" end="1:01.770">but</span> <span begin="1:01.850" end="1:02.090">too</span> <span begin="1:02.090" end="1:02.300">rare</span> <span begin="1:02.300" end="1:02.370">to</span> <span begin="1:02.490" end="1:02.750">die</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我怪异得难以苟活 却又稀有得不该死去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我怪異得難以苟活 卻又稀有得不該死去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">生きるには変わりすぎてるが 死ぬには希少すぎる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">살기엔 너무 별나지만 죽기엔 너무 귀한 존재야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis trop étrange pour vivre mais trop rare pour mourir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Soy demasiado extraño para vivir pero demasiado único para morir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich bin zu seltsam zum Leben doch zu selten zum Sterben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sou estranho demais para viver mas raro demais para morrer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я слишком странный чтобы жить но слишком редкий чтобы умереть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sono troppo strano per vivere ma troppo raro per morire</span></p><p begin="1:03.240" end="1:05.020" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:03.240" end="1:03.480">Don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:03.480" end="1:03.560">gi</span><span begin="1:03.560" end="1:03.620">ve</span> <span begin="1:03.620" end="1:03.710">up</span> <span begin="1:03.850" end="1:04.080">now,</span> <span begin="1:04.080" end="1:04.200">you</span> <span begin="1:04.200" end="1:04.340">gotta</span> <span begin="1:04.430" end="1:04.540">gi</span><span begin="1:04.540" end="1:04.570">ve</span> <span begin="1:04.570" end="1:04.640">it</span> <span begin="1:04.740" end="1:05.020">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在别放弃 你得给它一点时间</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">現在別放棄 你得給它一點時間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今は諦めるな 時間をかければいい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금 포기하지 마 시간이 필요할 뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">N’abandonne pas maintenant tu dois laisser le temps agir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No te rindas ahora tienes que darle tiempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gib jetzt nicht auf du musst dem Ganzen Zeit geben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não desista agora é preciso dar tempo ao tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не сдавайся сейчас всему нужно время</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non arrenderti adesso devi soltanto darti tempo</span></p><p begin="1:05.290" end="1:07.060" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:05.290" end="1:05.420">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:05.420" end="1:05.530">al</span><span begin="1:05.530" end="1:05.640">rea</span><span begin="1:05.640" end="1:05.760">dy</span> <span begin="1:05.760" end="1:05.910">writ</span><span begin="1:05.910" end="1:06.010">ten,</span> <span begin="1:06.010" end="1:06.180">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:06.180" end="1:06.300">all</span> <span begin="1:06.400" end="1:06.630">by</span> <span begin="1:06.630" end="1:06.740">de</span><span begin="1:06.740" end="1:07.060">sign</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切早已写定 一切皆有安排</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一切早已寫定 一切皆有安排</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すでに筋書きはできている すべてはそうなるようにできている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이미 쓰여 있어 전부 정해진 설계대로야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout est déjà écrit tout suit le plan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya está escrito todo forma parte del plan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es steht längst geschrieben alles folgt einem Plan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Já está escrito tudo faz parte do plano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё уже написано всё идёт по замыслу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È già tutto scritto fa tutto parte del disegno</span></p><p begin="1:07.370" end="1:08.930" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:07.370" end="1:07.550">Af</span><span begin="1:07.550" end="1:07.620">ter</span> <span begin="1:07.620" end="1:07.760">the</span> <span begin="1:07.760" end="1:07.910">shoot,</span> <span begin="1:07.990" end="1:08.120">they</span> <span begin="1:08.120" end="1:08.250">gi</span><span begin="1:08.250" end="1:08.360">ve</span> <span begin="1:08.360" end="1:08.470">back</span> <span begin="1:08.580" end="1:08.730">the</span> <span begin="1:08.730" end="1:08.930">whips</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拍摄结束后 他们就把豪车还回去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">拍攝結束後 他們就把豪車還回去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">撮影が終われば 奴らは高級車を返す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">촬영이 끝나면 그들은 멋진 차를 돌려줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Après le tournage ils rendent les bolides</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Después de la sesión devuelven los coches</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nach dem Dreh geben sie die Karren wieder zurück</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Depois da sessão eles devolvem os carrões</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">После съёмки они возвращают машины</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dopo lo shooting restituiscono le auto</span></p><p begin="1:08.960" end="1:10.900" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:08.960" end="1:09.080">They</span> <span begin="1:09.080" end="1:09.230">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:09.310" end="1:09.430">li</span><span begin="1:09.430" end="1:09.570">vin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:09.570" end="1:09.630">the</span> <span begin="1:09.730" end="1:09.920">li</span><span begin="1:09.920" end="1:10.060">ves</span> <span begin="1:10.060" end="1:10.190">that</span> <span begin="1:10.190" end="1:10.290">they</span> <span begin="1:10.290" end="1:10.500">show</span> <span begin="1:10.500" end="1:10.610">on</span><span begin="1:10.700" end="1:10.900">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们并没有过着网上展示的那种生活</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">他們並沒有過著網上展示的那種生活</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ネットで見せているような人生を 奴らは送っていない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">온라인에 보여 주는 그런 삶을 실제로 사는 것도 아니야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ils ne vivent pas la vie qu’ils affichent en ligne</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No viven las vidas que enseñan en internet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sie leben nicht das Leben das sie online zeigen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eles não vivem a vida que mostram na internet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Они не живут той жизнью что показывают в сети</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non vivono davvero le vite che mostrano online</span></p><p begin="1:11.200" end="1:13.680" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:11.200" end="1:11.310">I</span> <span begin="1:11.310" end="1:11.470">had</span> <span begin="1:11.470" end="1:11.650">un</span><span begin="1:11.650" end="1:11.800">der</span><span begin="1:11.800" end="1:11.930">dog</span> <span begin="1:12.020" end="1:12.190">psy</span><span begin="1:12.270" end="1:12.490">chosis</span> <span begin="1:12.490" end="1:12.670">since</span> <span begin="1:12.670" end="1:12.800">I</span> <span begin="1:12.800" end="1:12.910">made</span> <span begin="1:13.030" end="1:13.170">Black</span><span begin="1:13.290" end="1:13.520">lis</span><span begin="1:13.520" end="1:13.680">ted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自从做出《Blacklisted》起 我便一直怀着黑马的偏执</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">自從做出《Blacklisted》起 我便一直懷著黑馬的偏執</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">「Blacklisted」を作った時から 俺には負け犬の妄執があった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 《Blacklisted》를 만든 때부터 언더독 강박을 품고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’ai la psychose de l’outsider depuis que j’ai créé « Blacklisted »</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tengo la obsesión del desvalido desde que hice «Blacklisted»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Seit „Blacklisted“ trag ich diesen Underdog-Wahn in mir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tenho mentalidade de azarão desde que lancei «Blacklisted»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">С тех пор как я выпустил «Blacklisted» у меня психоз аутсайдера</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho questa psicosi da sfavorito da quando ho creato «Blacklisted»</span></p><p begin="1:13.680" end="1:14.780" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:13.680" end="1:13.790">And</span> <span begin="1:13.790" end="1:13.900">walked</span> <span begin="1:13.990" end="1:14.090">to</span> <span begin="1:14.090" end="1:14.210">the</span> <span begin="1:14.210" end="1:14.370">front</span> <span begin="1:14.370" end="1:14.460">of</span> <span begin="1:14.460" end="1:14.610">the</span> <span begin="1:14.610" end="1:14.780">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并一路走到了队伍最前方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">並一路走到了隊伍最前方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">そして列の先頭まで歩いてきた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">줄의 맨 앞으로 걸어 나왔어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et que je suis passé devant toute la file</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y avancé hasta el frente de la fila</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und kämpfte mich bis ganz nach vorn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E caminhei até o início da fila</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И я пробился в самое начало очереди</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E mi sono fatto largo fino in testa alla fila</span></p><p begin="1:14.840" end="1:16.360" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:14.840" end="1:14.940">So</span> <span begin="1:15.020" end="1:15.240">next</span> <span begin="1:15.240" end="1:15.470">time</span> <span begin="1:15.470" end="1:15.570">you</span> <span begin="1:15.570" end="1:15.640">get</span> <span begin="1:15.640" end="1:15.740">s</span><span begin="1:15.740" end="1:15.850">tuc</span><span begin="1:15.850" end="1:15.970">k in</span> <span begin="1:15.970" end="1:16.040">your</span> <span begin="1:16.120" end="1:16.360">mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以下次当你困在自己的思绪里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所以下次當你困在自己的思緒裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">だから次に自分の思考から抜け出せなくなった時は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그러니 다음에 또 생각 속에 갇히게 된다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors la prochaine fois que tu resteras prisonnier de tes pensées</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así que la próxima vez que te quedes atrapado en tu mente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du also wieder in deinen Gedanken feststeckst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então da próxima vez que ficar preso em seus pensamentos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И когда в следующий раз застрянешь в своих мыслях</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quindi la prossima volta che resti intrappolato nella tua mente</span></p><p begin="1:16.450" end="1:17.880" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:16.450" end="1:16.610">Just</span> <span begin="1:16.610" end="1:16.750">re</span><span begin="1:16.750" end="1:16.960">mem</span><span begin="1:16.960" end="1:17.060">ber</span> <span begin="1:17.060" end="1:17.200">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:17.200" end="1:17.330">one</span> <span begin="1:17.330" end="1:17.440">of</span> <span begin="1:17.440" end="1:17.490">a</span> <span begin="1:17.580" end="1:17.880">kind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要记住 你是独一无二的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只要記住 你是獨一無二的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">自分が唯一無二だと思い出せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 세상에 단 하나뿐인 존재란 걸 기억해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Rappelle-toi simplement que tu es unique</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo recuerda que no hay nadie como tú</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dann denk einfach daran dass du einzigartig bist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Apenas lembre que não existe ninguém como você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Просто помни ты такой один</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricorda soltanto che sei unico al mondo</span></p><p begin="1:17.810" end="1:21.080" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.810" end="1:17.940">Du</span> <span begin="1:17.940" end="1:18.180">bist</span> <span begin="1:18.180" end="1:18.440">gut</span> <span begin="1:18.440" end="1:18.490">ge</span><span begin="1:18.580" end="1:21.080">nug</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你已经足够好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你已經足夠好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are good enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君はそのままで十分だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 이미 충분히 잘하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es assez bien comme ça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eres más que suficiente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é bom o bastante</span><span ttm:role="x-translatio